/**
 * BatchRx — Version 4 (Authentic Trustly.com Design & Motion System).
 * Implements Trustly's real design grammar & signature interactions:
 * - Split-character masked slide-up headings
 * - Scroll-scrubbed word-by-word editorial reveal
 * - Triple-framed 3D perspective scroll-untilt hero
 * - Navbar mega-dropdowns with fullscreen blur backdrop
 * - Glassmorphic A2A band with parallax & pointer-tracking green spotlight
 * - Scroll-driven expanding 3-card width showcase with count-up stats
 * - 10-column asymmetric bento grid with expanding circle-arrow pill buttons
